cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, cite the accompanying article. To reference a
  specific state of the code and results, also cite the archived release.
title: "Predicting PROTAC Potency Differences: code and analysis results"
abstract: >-
  Author-written code and author-generated aggregate results for a comparison
  of direct prediction of signed PROTAC potency differences against the
  subtraction of two endpoint predictions, over 699 records, 511 molecular
  identities and 5,804 compatible pairs, under identity-based and
  source-component holdout.
type: software
